#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Privilege separation"
msgstr "Separação de privilégios"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Recent releases of <application>dhcpcd</application> optionally support "
"privilege separation. As the practical security benefits of this are unclear"
" for a program like <application>dhcpcd</application> and the setup is more "
"complicated, the book currently defaults to disable it."
msgstr ""
"Lançamentos recentes do &quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; "
"suportam opcionalmente a separação de privilégios. Como os benefícios "
"práticos de segurança disso não são claros para um aplicativo como o "
"&quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; e a configuração é mais "
"complicada, o livro atualmente usa como padrão desativá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you however would like to use privilege separation, additional "
"installation steps are necessary to set up the proper environment. Issue the"
" following commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"No entanto, se você quiser usar a separação de privilégios, [então] etapas "
"adicionais de instalação são necessárias para configurar o ambiente "
"adequado. Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem"
" class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install  -v -m700 -d /var/lib/dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"groupadd -g 52 dhcpcd        &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c 'dhcpcd PrivSep' \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/dhcpcd  \\\n"
"         -g dhcpcd           \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false       \\\n"
"         -u 52 dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown    -v dhcpcd:dhcpcd /var/lib/dhcpcd </userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install  -v -m700 -d /var/lib/dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"groupadd -g 52 dhcpcd        &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd  -c 'Separação de privilégios do dhcpcd' \\\n"
"         -d /var/lib/dhcpcd  \\\n"
"         -g dhcpcd           \\\n"
"         -s /bin/false       \\\n"
"         -u 52 dhcpcd &amp;&amp;\n"
"chown    -v dhcpcd:dhcpcd /var/lib/dhcpcd </userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of dhcpcd"
msgstr "Instalação do dhcpcd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>dhcpcd</application> without privilege separation by "
"running the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o &quot;<application>dhcpcd</application>&quot; sem separação de "
"privilégios executando o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --disable-privsep         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --disable-privsep         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Alternatively, build <application>dhcpcd</application> with privilege "
"separation by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativamente, construa o <application>dhcpcd</application> com separação"
" de privilégios executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --privsepuser=dhcpcd         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr               \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc            \\\n"
"            --libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd \\\n"
"            --dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd      \\\n"
"            --runstatedir=/run           \\\n"
"            --privsepuser=dhcpcd         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make test</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:170
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch sets a "
"better location for the dhcpcd internal libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--libexecdir=/usr/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave configura um"
" local melhor para bibliotecas internas do dhcpcd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:195
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch adjusts the "
"database directory because the default directory, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/db</filename>, is not FHS-compliant."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--dbdir=/var/lib/dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave ajusta o "
"diretório da base de dados, pois o diretório padrão, <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/db</filename>, não é compatível com o FHS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: This switch sets the runtime "
"state directory because the default <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> is a symbolic link to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename>, and using <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> is deprecated."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--runstatedir=/run</parameter>: Essa chave configura o diretório "
"de estado de tempo de execução, pois o padrão <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> é um link simbólico para <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename> e usar <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/var/run</filename> está obsoleto."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-privsep</parameter>: This switch disables privilege "
"separation, which is the default in dhcpcd. This switch is not used in the "
"build configuration where privilege separation is used."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-privsep</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a separação "
"de privilégios, que é o padrão no dhcpcd. Essa chave não é usada na "
"configuração da construção onde a separação de privilégios é usada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--privsepuser=dhcpcd</parameter>: This switch sets the privilege "
"separation user in the build configuration where privilege escalation is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--privsepuser=dhcpcd</parameter>: Essa chave configura o(a) "
"usuário(a) de separação de privilégios na configuração da construção onde o "
"escalonamento de privilégios é usado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-hook=...</option>: You can optionally install more hooks, for"
" example to install some configuration files such as "
"<filename>ntp.conf</filename>. A set of hooks can be found in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">dhcpcd-hooks</filename> directory in the build tree."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-hook=...</option>: Opcionalmente, você pode instalar mais "
"ganchos, por exemplo, para instalar alguns arquivos de configuração, como "
"<filename>ntp.conf</filename>. Um conjunto de ganchos pode ser encontrado no"
" diretório <filename class=\"directory\">dhcpcd-hooks</filename> na árvore "
"da construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring dhcpcd"
msgstr "Configurando o dhcpcd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/connect/dhcpcd.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

